# src/detect/.env.example
#
# Copy this file to src/detect/.env and fill in real values before running
# `docker compose -f src/detect/docker-compose.detect.yml up -d`.
#
# The .env file is listed in .gitignore and MUST NEVER be committed.
# There is intentionally no default for IMMUDB_ADMIN_PASSWORD. Compose will
# fail with a clear error message if this variable is unset or empty.
#
# SPEC-07 section 3 condition (c) - separation of duties:
#   The operator holds the immudb admin credential. The agent inside the
#   dev container has no immudb admin access. The ingest-proxy uses this
#   credential to write to immudb on the detect-net bridge; the agent
#   can only POST to the ingest-proxy's /ingest endpoint.
#
# Generate a strong password, for example:
#   openssl rand -base64 32
#
# Then set it here:

IMMUDB_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
